{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51083","headline":"七言记德诗三十首谨献司徒相公 收城碑 · 崔致远","name":"七言记德诗三十首谨献司徒相公 收城碑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"功业已标征北赋，威名初建镇南碑。\n终知不朽齐铜柱，况是儒宗缀色丝。\n（原注：碑，今度支裴仆射撰词。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51083.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51083","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}